DTEND:20270105T071500
SUMMARY:[RW] Tempo run (14 min tempo) (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:10 min warm-up\; 13 min easy\; 14 min tempo\; 8 min cool-down.
  Tempo is comfortably hard (RPE 6): short sentences only. Stop if anythin
 g hurts.\n\nWeek 7 (BUILD). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how yo
 u move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
