DTEND:20270119T072000
SUMMARY:[RW] Race-effort intervals (5 x 3 min) (50 min)
DESCRIPTION:12 min warm-up\; 5 min easy\; 5 x (3 min hard + 2 min easy)\; 
 8 min cool-down. Hard but controlled\; the last repeat should match the f
 irst. Stop if form falls apart.\n\nWeek 9 (PEAK). Not medical advice\; pa
 in that changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
