DTSTART:20270130T090000
DTEND:20270130T092000
SUMMARY:[RW] Activation (20 min easy run + 3 short pickups) (20 min)
DESCRIPTION:20 min easy with 3 pickups of 15 s at race effort. Pack your k
 it\, check your gear\, eat normally\, sleep.\n\nWeek 10 (TAPER). Not medi
 cal advice\; pain that changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2027-01-31-race-race-day-5-km-run@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003912Z
DTSTART:20270131T080000
DTEND:20270131T090000
SUMMARY:[RW] RACE DAY: 5 km run
DESCRIPTION:Start easier than feels necessary for the first third. Eat and
  drink as practised\, nothing new. It is a day to enjoy the work you did\
 ; no plan can promise a time.\n\nWeek 10 (RACE). Not medical advice\; pai
 n that changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
